title: Dashboard › Request drawer › Demo controls: approve, approve part or deny
route: /dashboard?request=R-1021
intro: The three final payer answers and what the Dashboard shows afterwards. An approval stays on the Dashboard with a write-back waiting. A partial approval or a denial turns the request into a new D- number and hands it to Denial Intelligence.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Payer decides (demo: the presenter clicks a Demo control)"
ext x1 "Payer decides through its portal, fax or phone\n(demo: simulated)"
click c1 "Click 'Approves'"
click c2 "Click 'Approves part'"
click c3 "Click 'Denies'"

group gA "Approved"
  store a1 "Stage Decided today, chip 'Approved' (green), bars full\nCadence holds it; next step 'Next review booked. Write-back waits for you'\nHistory 'The payer approved the request' and 'Cadence updated the ledger and booked the next review'"
  toast an "Notification 'Approved': 'R-1021 was approved. Write-back waits for you.'\nToast 'Demo: payer approves'"
  screen as "Dashboard after an approval\n'Decided today' goes up by one, 'Under review' goes down\nThe Decided today headline counts it as approved"
  overlay ab "Drawer shows the green box 'Approved. Write-back waits for you'"
endgroup
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Approve the write-back"
process qk "Quirk: 'Payer received it' on an approved request puts it back in Received but it still counts as Decided today"

group gD "Denied or partly approved"
  process d1 "Request gets a new number: D-3319, then D-3320 and so on\nThe old number R-1021 is gone; the case stays the same"
  store d2 "Stage Appeal or call, type 'Peer-to-peer', chip 'Call booked'\nAdvocate holds it; chance 61%; 3 days to the call window\nNext step 'Denied today. Advocate booked a peer-to-peer call'"
  store d3 "History 'The payer denied the request' or 'The payer approved only part of the request'\nthen 'Advocate opened the denial and booked a peer-to-peer call'"
  toast dn "Notification 'Denied' or 'Partly approved'\n'R-1021 became D-3319. Advocate booked a call.'"
  toast dt "Toast 'The payer denied it' or 'The payer approved part of it'\n'It is now D-3319 in Denial Intelligence.'"
  process d4 "Drawer switches to D-3319 in place (the address is replaced)\nOpening R-1021 again closes quietly: that number no longer exists"
  screen ds "Dashboard after a denial\n'Appeal or call' and 'Decided today' both go up by one; 'Under review' goes down\nSidebar badge on Denial Intelligence goes up\nA row hidden by the old stage filter leaves the table; the drawer stays open"
  screen dd "Drawer for D-3319\nChip 'Call booked', 'Chance of winning 61%', '3 days left'\nDemo controls disabled: 'A denial follows its own route in Denial Intelligence.'\nFooter gains 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"
endgroup
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials\n/denials?id=D-3319"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page\nThe case number is unchanged"

s1 --> x1 --> c1 & c2 & c3
c1 --> a1 --> an --> as --> ab --> g1
a1 -.-> qk
c2 --> d1
c3 --> d1
d1 --> d2 --> d3 --> dn --> dt --> d4
d4 --> ds
d4 --> dd
dd --> g2
dd --> g3
